{"text":"<p>https://youtu.be/XTSOh_I35c8?si=Lmg7I5WW3Vb42QA_</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0.350404\">00:00</span> ### 13. Appamaññāvibhaṅgo ^2-13-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Suttantabhājanīyaṃ ^2-13a-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2.750269\">00:02</span> 642. Catasso appamaññāyo – idha bhikkhu mettāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati, tathā dutiyaṃ, tathā tatiyaṃ, tathā catutthaṃ [catutthiṃ (sī.)]. Iti uddhamadho tiriyaṃ sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ lokaṃ mettāsahagatena cetasā vipulena mahaggatena appamāṇena averena abyāpajjena [abyāpajjhena (sī. syā.)] pharitvā viharati. Karuṇāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati, tathā dutiyaṃ, tathā tatiyaṃ, tathā catutthaṃ. Iti uddhamadho tiriyaṃ sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ lokaṃ karuṇāsahagatena cetasā vipulena mahaggatena appamāṇena averena abyāpajjena pharitvā viharati. Muditāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati, tathā dutiyaṃ, tathā tatiyaṃ, tathā catutthaṃ. Iti uddhamadho tiriyaṃ sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ lokaṃ muditāsahagatena cetasā vipulena mahaggatena appamāṇena averena abyāpajjena pharitvā viharati. Upekkhāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati, tathā dutiyaṃ, tathā tatiyaṃ, tathā catutthaṃ. Iti uddhamadho tiriyaṃ sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ lokaṃ upekkhāsahagatena cetasā vipulena mahaggatena appamāṇena averena abyāpajjena pharitvā viharati. ^2-13a-642</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1. Mettā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"135.816664\">02:15</span> 643. Kathañca bhikkhu mettāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati? Seyyathāpi nāma ekaṃ puggalaṃ piyaṃ manāpaṃ disvā mettāyeyya, evameva sabbe satte mettāya pharati. ^2-13a-643</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"155.394662\">02:35</span> Tattha katamā mettā? Yā sattesu metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"169.101543\">02:49</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ hadayaṃ paṇḍaraṃ mano manāyatanaṃ manindriyaṃ viññāṇaṃ viññāṇakkhandho tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya mettāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘mettāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"203.636302\">03:23</span> 644. ‘‘Ekaṃ disa’’nti puratthimaṃ vā disaṃ pacchimaṃ vā disaṃ uttaraṃ vā disaṃ dakkhiṇaṃ vā disaṃ uddhaṃ vā adho vā tiriyaṃ vā vidisaṃ vā. ^2-13a-644</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"219.64529\">03:39</span> 645. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-645</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"224.834549\">03:44</span> 646. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti iriyati vattati pāleti yapeti yāpeti carati viharati. Tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-646</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"238.671066\">03:58</span> 647. ‘‘Tathā dutiya’’nti yatheva ekaṃ disaṃ tathā dutiyaṃ disaṃ tathā tatiyaṃ disaṃ tathā catutthaṃ disaṃ tathā uddhaṃ tathā adho tathā tiriyaṃ tathā vidisaṃ. ^2-13a-647</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"257.369314\">04:17</span> 648. ‘‘Sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti sabbena sabbaṃ sabbathā sabbaṃ asesaṃ nissesaṃ. Pariyādāyavacanametaṃ – ‘‘sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti. ^2-13a-648</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"278.982213\">04:38</span> 649. ‘‘Mettāsahagatena cetasā’’ti tattha katamā mettā? Yā sattesu metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’. ^2-13a-649</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"296.398548\">04:56</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ…pe… tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya mettāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘mettāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"324.533136\">05:24</span> 650. ‘‘Vipulenā’’ti yaṃ vipulaṃ taṃ mahaggataṃ, yaṃ mahaggataṃ taṃ appamāṇaṃ, yaṃ appamāṇaṃ so avero, yo avero so abyāpajjo [abyāpajjho (sī. syā.)]. ^2-13a-650</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"341.692954\">05:41</span> 651. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-651</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"346.314928\">05:46</span> 652. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti…pe… tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-652</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 2. Karuṇā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"354.526764\">05:54</span> 653. Kathañca bhikkhu karuṇāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati? Seyyathāpi nāma ekaṃ puggalaṃ duggataṃ durūpetaṃ disvā karuṇāyeyya, evameva sabbe satte karuṇāya pharati. ^2-13a-653</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"374.967863\">06:14</span> Tattha katamā karuṇā? Yā sattesu karuṇā karuṇāyanā karuṇāyitattaṃ karuṇācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘karuṇā’’.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"389.375472\">06:29</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ…pe… tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya karuṇāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘karuṇāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"420.013545\">07:00</span> 654. ‘‘Ekaṃ disa’’nti puratthimaṃ vā disaṃ pacchimaṃ vā disaṃ uttaraṃ vā disaṃ dakkhiṇaṃ vā disaṃ uddhaṃ vā adho vā tiriyaṃ vā vidisaṃ vā. ^2-13a-654</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"435.860661\">07:15</span> 655. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-655</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"441.173494\">07:21</span> 656. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti iriyati vattati pāleti yapeti yāpeti carati viharati. Tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-656</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"449.174033\">07:29</span> 657. ‘‘Tathā dutiya’’nti yatheva ekaṃ disaṃ tathā dutiyaṃ disaṃ tathā tatiyaṃ disaṃ tathā catutthaṃ disaṃ tathā uddhaṃ tathā adho tathā tiriyaṃ tathā vidisaṃ. ^2-13a-657</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"468.566861\">07:48</span> 658. ‘‘Sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti sabbena sabbaṃ sabbathā sabbaṃ asesaṃ nissesaṃ. Pariyādāyavacanametaṃ – ‘‘sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti. ^2-13a-658</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"489.036199\">08:09</span> 659. ‘‘Karuṇāsahagatena cetasā’’ti tattha katamā karuṇā? Yā sattesu karuṇā karuṇāyanā karuṇāyitattaṃ karuṇācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘karuṇā’’. ^2-13a-659</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"508.159124\">08:28</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ…pe… tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya karuṇāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘karuṇāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"538.159101\">08:58</span> 660. ‘‘Vipulenā’’ti yaṃ vipulaṃ taṃ mahaggataṃ, yaṃ mahaggataṃ taṃ appamāṇaṃ, yaṃ appamāṇaṃ so avero, yo avero so abyāpajjo. ^2-13a-660</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"556.427498\">09:16</span> 661. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-661</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"562.262261\">09:22</span> 662. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti…pe… tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-662</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 3. Muditā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"570.38154\">09:30</span> 663. Kathañca bhikkhu muditāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati? Seyyathāpi nāma ekaṃ puggalaṃ piyaṃ manāpaṃ disvā mudito assa, evameva sabbe satte muditāya pharati. ^2-13a-663</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"592.413101\">09:52</span> Tattha katamā muditā? Yā sattesu muditā muditāyanā muditāyitattaṃ muditācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘muditā’’.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"607.412499\">10:07</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ…pe… tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya muditāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘muditāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"638.327878\">10:38</span> 664. ‘‘Ekaṃ disa’’nti puratthimaṃ vā disaṃ pacchimaṃ vā disaṃ uttaraṃ vā disaṃ dakkhiṇaṃ vā disaṃ uddhaṃ vā adho vā tiriyaṃ vā vidisaṃ vā. ^2-13a-664</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"656.904897\">10:56</span> 665. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-665</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"661.146246\">11:01</span> 666. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti…pe… tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-666</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"669.055221\">11:09</span> 667. ‘‘Tathā dutiya’’nti yatheva ekaṃ disaṃ tathā dutiyaṃ disaṃ tathā tatiyaṃ disaṃ tathā catutthaṃ disaṃ tathā uddhaṃ tathā adho tathā tiriyaṃ tathā vidisaṃ. ^2-13a-667</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"691.660236\">11:31</span> 668. ‘‘Sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti sabbena sabbaṃ sabbathā sabbaṃ asesaṃ nissesaṃ. Pariyādāyavacanametaṃ – ‘‘sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti. ^2-13a-668</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"713.285867\">11:53</span> 669. ‘‘Muditāsahagatena cetasā’’ti tattha katamā muditā? Yā sattesu muditā muditāyanā muditāyitattaṃ muditācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘muditā’’. ^2-13a-669</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"732.473686\">12:12</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ…pe… tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya muditāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘muditāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"763.165167\">12:43</span> 670. ‘‘Vipulenā’’ti yaṃ vipulaṃ taṃ mahaggataṃ, yaṃ mahaggataṃ taṃ appamāṇaṃ, yaṃ appamāṇaṃ so avero, yo avero so abyāpajjo. ^2-13a-670</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"781.679837\">13:01</span> 671. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-671</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"787.671011\">13:07</span> 672. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti …pe… tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-672</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 4. Upekkhā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"795.985301\">13:15</span> 673. Kathañca bhikkhu upekkhāsahagatena cetasā ekaṃ disaṃ pharitvā viharati? Seyyathāpi nāma ekaṃ puggalaṃ neva manāpaṃ na amanāpaṃ disvā upekkhako assa, evameva sabbe satte upekkhāya pharati. ^2-13a-673</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"820.698584\">13:40</span> Tattha katamā upekkhā? Yā sattesu upekkhā upekkhāyanā upekkhāyitattaṃ upekkhācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘upekkhā’’.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"836.180599\">13:56</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ…pe… tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya upekkhāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘upekkhāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"867.163815\">14:27</span> 674. ‘‘Ekaṃ disa’’nti puratthimaṃ vā disaṃ pacchimaṃ vā disaṃ uttaraṃ vā disaṃ dakkhiṇaṃ vā disaṃ uddhaṃ vā adho vā tiriyaṃ vā vidisaṃ vā. ^2-13a-674</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"885.054234\">14:45</span> 675. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-675</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"890.299763\">14:50</span> 676. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti…pe… tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-676</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"898.607953\">14:58</span> 677. ‘‘Tathā dutiya’’nti yatheva ekaṃ disaṃ tathā dutiyaṃ disaṃ tathā tatiyaṃ disaṃ tathā catutthaṃ disaṃ tathā uddhaṃ tathā adho tathā tiriyaṃ tathā vidisaṃ. ^2-13a-677</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"920.734763\">15:20</span> 678. ‘‘Sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti sabbena sabbaṃ sabbathā sabbaṃ asesaṃ nissesaṃ. Pariyādāyavacanametaṃ – ‘‘sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṃ loka’’nti. ^2-13a-678</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"941.533282\">15:41</span> 679. ‘‘Upekkhāsahagatena cetasā’’ti, tattha katamā upekkhā? Yā sattesu upekkhā upekkhāyanā upekkhāyitattaṃ upekkhācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘upekkhā’’. ^2-13a-679</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"961.194794\">16:01</span> Tattha katamaṃ cittaṃ? Yaṃ cittaṃ mano mānasaṃ…pe… tajjāmanoviññāṇadhātu – idaṃ vuccati ‘‘cittaṃ’’. Idaṃ cittaṃ imāya upekkhāya sahagataṃ hoti sahajātaṃ saṃsaṭṭhaṃ sampayuttaṃ. Tena vuccati ‘‘upekkhāsahagatena cetasā’’ti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"990.987952\">16:30</span> 680. ‘‘Vipulenā’’ti yaṃ vipulaṃ taṃ mahaggataṃ, yaṃ mahaggataṃ taṃ appamāṇaṃ, yaṃ appamāṇaṃ so avero, yo avero so abyāpajjo. ^2-13a-680</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1009.248597\">16:49</span> 681. ‘‘Pharitvā’’ti pharitvā adhimuccitvā. ^2-13a-681</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1014.799061\">16:54</span> 682. ‘‘Viharatī’’ti…pe… tena vuccati ‘‘viharatī’’ti. ^2-13a-682</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1029.049466\">17:09</span> Suttantabhājanīyaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Abhidhammabhājanīyaṃ ^2-13b-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1032.285082\">17:12</span> 683. Catasso appamaññāyo – mettā, karuṇā, muditā, upekkhā. ^2-13b-683</p><p><br /></p><p>684. Tattha katamā mettā? Idha bhikkhu yasmiṃ samaye rūpūpapattiyā maggaṃ bhāveti vivicceva kāmehi…pe… paṭhamaṃ jhānaṃ upasampajja viharati mettāsahagataṃ , yā tasmiṃ samaye metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’. Avasesā dhammā mettāya sampayuttā. ^2-13b-684</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1075.406548\">17:55</span> Tattha katamā mettā? Idha bhikkhu yasmiṃ samaye rūpūpapattiyā maggaṃ bhāveti vitakkavicārānaṃ vūpasamā…pe… dutiyaṃ jhānaṃ upasampajja viharati mettāsahagataṃ, yā tasmiṃ samaye metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’. Avasesā dhammā mettāya sampayuttā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1112.372798\">18:32</span> Tattha katamā mettā? Idha bhikkhu yasmiṃ samaye rūpūpapattiyā maggaṃ bhāveti pītiyā ca virāgā…pe… tatiyaṃ jhānaṃ upasampajja viharati mettāsahagataṃ, yā tasmiṃ samaye metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’. Avasesā dhammā mettāya sampayuttā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1148.346168\">19:08</span> 685. Idha bhikkhu yasmiṃ samaye rūpūpapattiyā maggaṃ bhāveti vivicceva kāmehi…pe… paṭhamaṃ jhānaṃ upasampajja viharati mettāsahagataṃ, yā tasmiṃ samaye metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’. Avasesā dhammā mettāya sampayuttā. ^2-13b-685</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1181.255027\">19:41</span> Idha bhikkhu yasmiṃ samaye rūpūpapattiyā maggaṃ bhāveti vivicceva kāmehi vivicca akusalehi dhammehi avitakkaṃ vicāramattaṃ vivekajaṃ pītisukhaṃ dutiyaṃ jhānaṃ upasampajja viharati mettāsahagataṃ, yā tasmiṃ samaye metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’. Avasesā dhammā mettāya sampayuttā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1221.616358\">20:21</span> Idha bhikkhu yasmiṃ samaye rūpūpapattiyā maggaṃ bhāveti vitakkavicārānaṃ vūpasamā…pe… tatiyaṃ jhānaṃ upasampajja viharati mettāsahagataṃ, yā tasmiṃ samaye metti mettāyanā mettāyitattaṃ mettācetovimutti – ayaṃ vuccati ‘‘mettā’’. Avasesā dhammā mettāya sampayuttā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\